COMPILATION OF: E46L9

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program
S: Symbol Table List

  SYMBOLS:

BLOCK AT LINE 1, AUTO STORAGE 0 BYTES
a 0000 E46L9 ENTRY PARAMETERS(0) EXTERNAL CONSTANT
BLOCK AT LINE 3, AUTO STORAGE 2 BYTES
c 0000 OUTF FILE EXTERNAL STATIC
c 0000 K FIXED BINARY(15,0) AUTOMATIC
   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46L9

   1 a 0000 E46L9:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 c 0006   dcl outf file, k fixed bin(15);
   4 c 0006   k = 3;
   5 c 000C   open file(outf) stream output title('L9OUT DAT');
   6 c 0029   put file(outf) list(k + 1);
   7 c 0044   close file(outf);
   8 a 004A end E46L9;

CODE SIZE = 004D
DATA AREA = 000B
FREE SYMS = 3892
END  COMPILATION
